Gen. Worden, played by Ernest Borgnine.

7
00:44:20,000 --> 00:44:26,000
Louis Valentine, played by Ken Wahl.

8
00:50:40,000 --> 00:50:46,000
Tommy Wells, played by Larry Wilcox.

9
