Sam Sixkiller, played by Sonny Landham.

10
01:03:20,000 --> 01:03:26,000
Sgt. Bowren, played by Richard Jaeckel.

11
01:09:40,000 --> 01:09:46,000
The Dirty Dozen: Next Mission is a 1985 made-for-TV film and sequel to
the original 1967 film Dirty Dozen, directed by Andrew V.

12
01:16:00,000 --> 01:16:06,000
McLaglen and reuniting Lee Marvin, Ernest Borgnine and Richard
Jaeckel 18 years after the original hit war film.

13
01:22:20,000 --> 01:22:26,000
Marvin returns to lead an all-new dirty dozen on a mission to
assassinate SS General Sepp Dietrich, played by Wolf Kahler.

14
01:28:40,000 --> 01:28:46,000
The film explores themes of army, prisoner, nazi, world war ii, sequel.
